come to the riverbank.

280
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:28,620
Damn it, they didn't just do it to me,
they got these two too.

281
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:30,440
Shinji, it's your big moment,
I'm counting on you.

282
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:41,920
If Kankichi doesn't show up,
we're throwing you in the river.

283
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,840
Kankichi will definitely come.

284
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:45,820
