328
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,700
Shut up already, you're so annoying.

329
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:23,240
Hey, you!

330
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:27,520
Where's the patience?
You get riled up right away!

331
