What kind of thing is that to do?

376
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:46,520
Next time: Ancestors, hello!

377
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:47,900
Nice to meet you.

378
00:25:47,900 --> 00:25:51,240
Over there, that's Kameari-ari.

379
00:25:51,780 --> 00:25:54,420
Well, I'm sure it's Kameari-ari.

380
00:25:54,420 --> 00:25:59,260
Everyone, come on over to our town!

381
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:00,840
